        "description": "Early Access Notice: Bow-Bots is still in development, so you may encounter unfinished features and areas that need polishing. And by that, I mean a lot of polish! :)\n\nOur player base is currently small, so we recommend inviting a friend to join you for the best experience! \n\nBow-Bots is a passion project crafted by a very small team, and we’d love your feedback to help improve it. Join our Discord community and be part of the journey!\n\n🎯 Join the Official Discord🎯 https://discord.gg/6QFVexRkYn\n\n🏹 About Bow-Bots 🏹\n\nBow-Bots pits you against other players in a thrilling 6-player free-for-all, with an upcoming 3v3 mode. \n\nArmed only with a bow and arrow, you'll navigate a game within a game. Bow-Bots features a unique item system where hitting targets around the map grants you powerful arrows. Landing a shot on the golden bullseyes makes your arrows even more powerful. \n\nThe better your aim, the better your equipment. Experience the excitement and strategy of Bow-Bots!",
